sequenceDiagram
    actor User
    participant Front as Frontend (React)
    participant AI as MediaPipe (AI)
    participant Server as Backend (Express)
    participant DB as MySQL

    User->>Front: 세션 시작
    Front->>Server: POST /api/sessions { mode }
    Server->>DB: INSERT INTO sessions
    DB-->>Server: session_id 반환
    Server-->>Front: session_id

    loop 실시간 자세 분석
        Front->>AI: 웹캠 프레임 전달
        AI-->>Front: 자세 점수 / 상태 반환
        Front->>Server: POST /api/sessions/:id/logs
        Server->>DB: INSERT INTO posture_logs
    end

    User->>Front: 세션 종료
    Front->>Server: PATCH /api/sessions/:id/end { score, alertCount }
    Server->>DB: UPDATE sessions SET ended_at
    Server->>DB: UPSERT daily_statistics
    DB-->>Server: 완료
    Server-->>Front: 세션 종료 완료
    Front-->>User: 결과 화면 표시